cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Apothem in your research or tooling, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Apothem"
type: software
abstract: >
  Apothem is a host-agnostic AI harness configuration manager. It provides
  a unified shared-profile schema and a set of harness adapters that materialize
  per-harness configuration files from a single source of truth, enabling
  consistent AI assistant behavior across seventeen AI assistant harnesses —
  among them Claude Code, Cursor, Gemini CLI, and GitHub Copilot.
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-07-06"
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/ahmed-g-gad/apothem"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ahmed-g-gad/apothem"
keywords:
  - ai
  - llm
  - developer-tools
  - claude-code
  - cursor
  - gemini-cli
  - github-copilot
  - harness
  - configuration-management
  - automation
